Adequate ventilation shall be provided for the basement. The standards of ventilation shall be the 
same as required by the particular occupancy according to byelaws. Any deficiency may be met by 
providing adequate mechanical ventilation in the form of blowers or exhaust fans at the rate of one 
exhaust fan for 50 sq. mt. floor area. 


